    "detailed_description": "Are you a rookie? Or a professional? Whatever!<br><br>Play Online Poker without restriction or cost! Compete with community, your friends or family with this truly free Texas Hold'em Poker.<br><br>In No Limit, Pot Limit, Split Limit poker you can train and improve your poker skills - or just play for fun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Play online for free:</strong> only few clicks and seconds to start<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Online community with players all over the world<br></li><li><strong>Private games:</strong> Play with family or friends in private lobbies<br></li><li><strong>Single player against A.I.:</strong> Click EMPTY slots to add bots<br></li><li><strong>Powerful A.I.:</strong> 3 different levels of difficulty<br></li><li><strong>All limit types:</strong> No limit, pot limit and split limit<br></li><li><strong>Environment configurable:</strong> 10 different tables and environments available<br></li><li><strong>Chips and card design configurable:</strong> Dollar or Euro chips or Euro coins<br></li><li><strong>Realistic full 3D-animated graphics, voice output and sound effects</strong><br></li><li><strong>Tutorial</strong> and detailed game help</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note for Linux and Steam Deck users:</h2>To run the game correctly on <strong>Linux or Steam Deck</strong>, make sure to enable <strong>Force Proton</strong> in the compatibility settings.",
